waffle-relay uses the Waffle fetch transport contract and platform APIs. It contains no vendored third-party source.

The optional WebTransport server uses @fails-components/webtransport 1.6.11 and
@fails-components/webtransport-transport-http3-quiche 1.6.11, BSD-3-Clause,
revision 71d1ba5147c7733fbfd3a375116b9f58484d9f13. Their source and native
prebuilds are separately installed dependencies, not vendored in this package.
